<title>SINGAPORE: Yeo Hiap Seng in Beijing drinks venture.</title>
<headline>Yeo Hiap Seng in Beijing drinks venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soft drinks group Yeo Hiap Seng Ltd (YHS) said on Friday it had taken a 51 percent stake in a joint venture in Beijing, China to make soft drinks.</p>
<p>A company statement said Yeo Hiap Seng (Hua Bei) Beverages Co Ltd would have a registered capital of US$6 million.</p>
<p>YHS's partners in the venture would be China Guangzhou Xin Zhu Jiang Food &amp; Beverage Group and Sstal Engineering Ltd on Hong Kong.</p>
<p>It said there were plans to set up a new plant near Beijing to be completed in 1998. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
